{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XG8mxFQJcWjmQCEHsXLbBZ","type":"tool_result","content":"372\t- Governance read views (spec `pose-governance-read-view-generation`) — inspect `snapshot.read_view` in `state --attention --json` and `pose_obligations`: its own `schema_version: 1`, observed-input ID, engine/parser versions and root bindings describe one operation. The enclosing report stays at schema version 1. Review and closeout JSON expose the same contract in `read_view`. The ID binds consumed bytes, directory observations, errors and absences; revision, dirty state, size and mtime alone do not prove equivalence. `current` describes the final audit instant only. Coherence, producer coverage and freshness are separate: `unknown` or incomplete coverage must never be read as nothing owed or as write authorization. A historical report without this binding remains readable and proves no current authorization."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"5ea8fc83-8c7c-4aea-9ef5-4bc7100e38db","timestamp":"2026-11-06T19:09:48.277Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/pose-review-run-3263644701/worktree/POSE.md","content":"- Governance read views (spec `pose-governance-read-view-generation`) — inspect `snapshot.read_view` in `state --attention --json` and `pose_obligations`: its own `schema_version: 1`, observed-input ID, engine/parser versions and root bindings describe one operation. The enclosing report stays at schema version 1. Review and closeout JSON expose the same contract in `read_view`. The ID binds consumed bytes, directory observations, errors and absences; revision, dirty state, size and mtime alone do not prove equivalence. `current` describes the final audit instant only. Coherence, producer coverage and freshness are separate: `unknown` or incomplete coverage must never be read as nothing owed or as write authorization. A historical report without this binding remains readable and proves no current authorization.","numLines":1,"startLine":372,"totalLines":1001}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XG8mxFQJcWjmQCEHsXLbBZ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
